{"id": 7489, "raw": "<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hitre povezave</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://cal.com/matteocigala/15min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Rezerviraj klic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.vivifysports.com/nutritionalcoaching\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Prehranski posvet z Marine</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/353834777697\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp Matteo</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.skool.com/cigala-cycling-collective-1115\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Skupnost na Skoolu</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Skupnost na Skoolu je za športnike, ki jih treniram, brezplačna. Povabila še nimaš? <a href=\"mailto:matteo@cigalacycling.com?subject=Skool%20invitation\">Pošlji mi email</a> in ti ga pošljem (preveri tudi mapo z neželeno pošto, včasih pristane tam).</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tvoje aplikacije za trening</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tvoj načrt je v Vekti in se sinhronizira z Garminom, Wahoojem ali Zwiftom.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://app.joinvekta.com/me/calendar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Odpri moj koledar v Vekti</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Knjižnica za trening</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Moč in core</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7504,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7504\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7504\">Raztezanje in core</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7504\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7505,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7505\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7505\">Krožni trening v fitnesu: zima, prvi mesec</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7505\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7506,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7506\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7506\">Krožni trening v fitnesu: zima, drugi in tretji mesec</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7506\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7507,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7507\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7507\">Krožni trening v fitnesu: med sezono</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7507\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><