o delili.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeyoyBDI1Rl/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Poglej, kako deluje (video Vekta)</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/cigalacycling/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instagram</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vredno branja</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Novo na blogu (v angleščini)</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:shortcode -->[cc_latest_posts lang=\"en\"]<!-- /wp:shortcode --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Trening (v angleščini)</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/zone-2-training/\">Moč treninga v coni 2</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/critical-power/\">Critical Power (kritična moč)</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/w-prime/\">Kaj je W′ (W prime)?</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/critical-power-testing/\">Testiranje kritične moči: kako do zanesljivih podatkov</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/strength-training-for-cyclists/\">Trening moči za kolesarje</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/calibrate-a-power-meter/\">Kako umeriti merilnik moči</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\